OL,3,AAfter its record launch, GTA 6 sets its
OL,4,Asights on the music charts             
OL,6,FGrand Theft Auto 6 has been swerving   
OL,7,Finto online feeds and cultural         
OL,8,Fconversations since its record-breaking
OL,9,Flaunch last week.                      
OL,11,FBut one area where the game is really  
OL,12,Fmaking a dent is the world of music.   
OL,14,FFlower In A Hurricane, the single from 
OL,15,Fthe game's official soundtrack album by
OL,16,FJustice featuring Tame Impala, SZA and 
OL,17,FKing Gizzard & The Lizard Wizard, is   
OL,18,Ftipped to climb the UK's official top  
OL,19,Ften later.                             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
