OL,3,AAfter its record launch, GTA 6 sets its
OL,4,Asights on the music charts             
OL,6,FGo Easy, a new track from Dua Lipa     
OL,7,Fspecially recorded by the singer for   
OL,8,Fthe game, is also expected to perform  
OL,9,Fwell.                                  
